OL,3,GNEWSAHigh street revamp wins trader
OL,4,Apraise
OL,5,
OL,6,FA trader has welcomed the revamp of a
OL,7,FWest Midlands high street after major
OL,8,Fimprovement work was completed.
OL,10,FNew paving, lighting, planting and
OL,11,Fseating have been added on Wednesfield
OL,12,FHigh Street, as well as improved
OL,13,Fpedestrian crossings which
OL,14,FWolverhampton MP Sureena Brackenridge
OL,15,Fdescribed as a "real vote of
OL,16,Fconfidence" in the area's future.
OL,18,FJon Paul Allen, market trader, key
OL,19,Fcutter and shoe repairer, said the work
OL,20,Fhad made "a significant difference",
OL,21,Fenhancing the town and making it a
OL,22,Fwelcoming place to visit.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
